        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-2",
        "text": "当地面汇水距离不大于90m时，可按公式计算：ta=10.41(n0·L)^0.6 / (q^0.4·S^0.3)。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_571002af76acd54f97035960931ed705",
          "chunk_89bd31d23849f12fb6bddfdf3e7c8924"
        ],
        "verified": false
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-3",
        "text": "上述公式中，ta为地面集水时间(min)，n0为粗糙系数，L为地面集水距离(m)，q为设计暴雨强度[L/(s·ha)]。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_89bd31d23849f12fb6bddfdf3e7c8924",
          "chunk_4ac45add12a67f24df18608f8b1d3c2d"
        ],
        "verified": false
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-4",
        "text": "《室外排水设计标准》规定，地面集水时间宜采用5min~15min。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_55c6b1f104174f1a8a7f2aabb66f1d61"
